  BillionSend extension: returns up to 1000 contacts by id or by email address in one request, in request order, optionally with their properties and topic subscriptions. Entries that match no contact are listed under `missing` instead of failing the call. One call counts as one request against the rate limit.

  `POST /contacts/batch/get`

